WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.050
Chun-Li starts with her back near the corner as Ryu approaches.

2
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.450
Chun-Li’s Drive Impact counters Ryu’s attempt.

3
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.400
Down-forward heavy kick moves Chun-Li across the crumpled opponent.

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.500
Light Spinning Bird Kick continues the juggle after the side switch.

5
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:06.950
Chun-Li finishes on the other side with Ryu near the wall.
